41
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,631
What do I need to remember?

42
00:03:03,167 --> 00:03:08,362
running describes the process; healthy describes the application.

43
00:03:08,362 --> 00:03:09,801
They can disagree.

44
00:03:10,367 --> 00:03:16,961
Restart policies act only when the process exits; a hung process is never restarted by them.

45
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:20,618
