83
00:06:14,470 --> 00:06:20,178
The cache container's memory limit is the 64 MiB you set; web has no limit,

84
00:06:20,178 --> 00:06:26,420
so its limit is the memory of the whole Docker engine (on Docker Desktop, its VM).

